SPARKEntropy
============

SPARKEntropy is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. See LICENSE.

Third-party attributions
------------------------

Jitterentropy

  SPARKEntropy is based on the Jitterentropy CPU-jitter entropy collection
  algorithm by Stephan Mueller. This crate is an independent SPARK/Ada
  implementation and does not incorporate Jitterentropy library source code.

libkeccak

  SPARKEntropy depends on libkeccak for the SHAKE-256 conditioning sponge.
  libkeccak is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause License by Daniel King.

NIST SP 800-90B EntropyAssessment

  The CI entropy-assessment workflow can build and run the NIST SP 800-90B
  EntropyAssessment tool suite as an external test tool. The NIST tool source
  is not incorporated into this crate.
